  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><h3><strong>Soulyshine Affiliate Program</strong></h3><p><strong>• About our brand and products:</strong>Soulyshine creates high-quality, personalized jewelry designed specifically for pet lovers. We specialize in meaningful, custom pieces that celebrate the deep emotional bond between \"dog moms\" and their fur babies, turning cherished memories into wearable art.</p><p><strong>• What makes us different:</strong>We move beyond generic accessories. Every Soulyshine piece is crafted with intention and emotional storytelling. Our focus on the \"pet parent\" lifestyle ensures our jewelry isn’t just a product—it’s a tribute that resonates deeply with our community.</p><p><strong>• How affiliates can earn:</strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Commission:</strong> Earn a competitive <strong>15% commission</strong> on every referred sale.</p></li><li><p><strong>Cookie Window:</strong> A <strong>30-day tracking window</strong> ensures you get paid for customers who take time to customize their orders.</p></li><li><p><strong>Reliable Payouts:</strong> Monthly payments delivered directly via PayPal.</p></li></ul><p><strong>• How to promote us:</strong>Share your unique Soulyshine pieces through unboxing videos on <strong>TikTok and Reels</strong>, or feature us in <strong>\"Gift Guides for Pet Lovers.\"</strong> Authentic storytelling about your own pet journey drives the highest conversions within the \"Dog Mom\" community.</p><p><strong>• Other information:</strong>Affiliates gain access to a dedicated dashboard with high-res lifestyle imagery, pre-written copy, and early access to new product launches.</p></div></div>",
